.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Mach-O disassembly module for Baseer\&. 

Provides disassembly of executable sections in Mach-O files using the udis86 engine, with per-function symbol labeling\&. 
.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "bool print_macho_disasm (\fBbparser\fP * parser, void * arg)"

.PP
Disassemble executable sections of a Mach-O binary\&. Iterates over all segments/sections, finds those with executable attributes (S_ATTR_PURE_INSTRUCTIONS), and disassembles them\&. If a symbol table is present, functions are labeled by name\&.

.PP
