.RS 4
\fIparser\fP Pointer to the bparser with the file loaded in memory\&. 
.br
\fIarg\fP Pointer to inputs struct (unused for disasm)\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
true on success, false on error\&. 
